{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Flows\/documentation\/Flows","doc:\/\/Flows\/documentation\/Flows\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/Flows\/documentation\/Flows\/GraphProtocols\/Graph"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A global minimum cut over "},{"code":"directedView","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", or nil below two vertices."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"minimumCut","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"capacity","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Edges-swift.associatedtype","text":"Edges","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5EdgesQa","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Index","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Flows\/documentation\/Flows\/Cut","text":"Cut","preciseIdentifier":"s:5Flows3CutV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedView","text":"DirectedView","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols12DirectedViewV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">? ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AdditiveArithmetic","preciseIdentifier":"s:s18AdditiveArithmeticP","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Comparable","preciseIdentifier":"s:SL","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The cut minimizes the capacity of the edges between a nonempty proper vertex set and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rest. The side holding the first vertex is the source side. Computed by Nagamochi–Ibaraki:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"maximum adjacency orderings that contract every edge whose scanned connection is at least"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the best cut so far. Which minimum cut is returned when several exist is unspecified, but"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the same input always gives the same cut."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When the edges of positive capacity do not connect the graph, the result is the cut of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"value zero whose source side is the first vertex’s component, with every crossing edge.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Parallel capacities add and self-loops are ignored. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"capacity"},{"text":" is called once per non-loop","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"edge, in position order, before any work.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Sums are formed in a wider type than "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"C"},{"type":"text","text":" where needed ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int128"},{"type":"text","text":" for fixed-width"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"integers, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Double"},{"type":"text","text":" for "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Float"},{"type":"text","text":"), so a contracted group’s connection may exceed "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"C"},{"type":"text","text":"’s range."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"aside","name":"Complexity","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"O(nm log n) in the worst case.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note"},{"type":"aside","name":"Precondition","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Every capacity is at least zero, not NaN and finite, and the minimum cut’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"value fits in ","type":"text"},{"code":"C","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (it is at most every vertex’s capacity sum).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","extendedModule":"GraphProtocols","roleHeading":"Instance Method","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Flows\/GlobalMinimumCut.swift#L484","fileName":"GlobalMinimumCut.swift"},"modules":[{"name":"Flows","relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"]}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"minimumCut","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"capacity","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Edges","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5EdgesQa"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Index","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Cut","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:5Flows3CutV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"DirectedView","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols12DirectedViewV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":